      "path": "app/grammar-classroom/live/lessons/g239.ts",
      "text": "And you? How are you?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/grammar-classroom/live/lessons/g239.ts",
      "text": "In Argentina people say “vos” instead of “tú”. Same meaning: “you”. You can keep saying “tú”: your grandparents will understand you perfectly."
    },
